  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-06-03T12:31:50.227Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you enable PhysBones in the Avatar Overlay option in the quick menu, even though components that are children of the head are invisible locally to the player, the physbones volumes for them are still present.\nIn the case of hair, these can obscure the player's view, even though the mesh is not present.\nIdeally these should be made to be invisible from PlayerLocal, but kept in MirrorReflection so we can observe using a mirror or camera.",
